{"overview":"یوهو آساکورا شامی است، شخصی که با ارواح ارتباط برقرار می‌کند. او در مسابقه شامی شرکت می‌کند؛ برنده‌ی این تورنمنت می‌تواند با روح بزرگ، خدا، ارتباط برقرار کند… و عروس‌اش آنا می‌خواهد همسر شامی‌کینگ شود. دوستانش مانتا، هورو هورو، ریو و شریک شومی سامورای او، آمیدامارو، در این مسیر به او کمک می‌کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Asakura Yoh is a shaman, a person who communicates with ghosts. He enters the Shaman Fight, for whoever wins the tournament gets to commune with the Great Spirit, God... that and his fiance Anna wants to be the wife of the Shaman King. Helping him are his friends Manta, Horo Horo, Ryu, and his samurai ghost partner, Amidamaru.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":64,"y":2001,"poster":"/46xoD5J7oKSjQkfao0V7UcjjZie.jpg"}],"episodes":64,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"犬山イヌコ","role":"Manta Oyamada","photo":"/bA6BQgafhEyRFMh4EbZQJqvIVWY.jpg","en":"Inuko Inuyama"},{"name":"کاتسویوکی کونیشی","role":"Amidamaru / Luchist Lasso / Blamuro","photo":"/nYM5cH6U7cp4x9dIzW0enmEKmeV.jpg","en":"Katsuyuki Konishi"},{"name":"田中正彦","role":"Rio, Turbine","photo":"/ozi2h5bDv82EkYLJYSazrO3dzjh.jpg","en":"Masahiko Tanaka"},{"name":"佐藤ゆうこ","role":"Yoh Asakura","photo":"","en":"Yuuko Satou"},{"name":"林原めぐみ","role":"Anna Kyōyama / Opacho","photo":"/3Alm4pmBIxpeeh0Sdippxdbkpne.jpg","en":"Megumi Hayashibara"},{"name":"朴璐美","role":"Ren Tao","photo":"/fl9vyA3HEkOyTiZBJBhAR3OSmrO.jpg","en":"Romi Park"},{"name":"子安武人","role":"Faust VIII","photo":"/8uBkNDKPNmp9JWgMUI02NVyfhi1.jpg","en":"Takehito Koyasu"},{"name":"沢海陽子","role":"Lyserg","photo":"/4gUG0v1HJPh0gLba6XOcLvTMpto.jpg","en":"Yoko Soumi"},{"name":"うえだゆうじ","role":"Horohoro","photo":"/nwJBK4WwsUCcBcX425GD2BroJDr.jpg","en":"Yuji Ueda"},{"name":"緑川光","role":"Silva / Patch Hao","photo":"/pvzfUDE9UruEhRBrONVFk83o6Zh.jpg","en":"Hikaru Midorikawa"},{"name":"高山みなみ","role":"Hao Asakura","photo":"/4Gunxt2UWnAX74ZoXKtqK2rI0e.jpg","en":"Minami Tak